sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor UserA as "User A"
    actor UserB as "User B"
    participant API as "API"
    participant Worker as "Analyzer"
    participant Storage as "Azure Table Storage"

    UserA->>API: Update preferences and queue analysis
    UserB->>API: Update preferences and queue analysis
    API->>Storage: Persist each user partition separately
    API->>Worker: Queue background work
    Worker->>Storage: Write derived metrics
    Note over API,Storage: Ownership checks prevent cross-user collisions.
    Note over Worker,Storage: Latest successful repository derivation wins within one user scope.